{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>It is not the voice of them that shout for mastery.</b> This voice does not sound like the voice of the shout of mighty men crying 'Victory!' nor like the voice of the weak who cry 'Woe, we are overpowered!'" "<b>Voice of them that answer.</b> A voice of taunts and revilings — that afflict the soul of the hearer when spoken to him."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:09.504028183Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}